      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Small-type marginal note reading 'one person', set in the narrow slot to the right of the 少參事 count 三員. In this table a small-type item in that slot annotates the full-size column immediately to its left (the facing page 435 sets 公議人 the same way, in the slot to the right of the name 今井金平), so this note attaches to 少參事 三員. What it qualifies is not printed; it is transcribed as printed and not folded into the 少參事 count."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "佐伯藩少參事傍小書一人"
