      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Acting junior councillor: Yamaguchi Tōzaemon. The office slot at the head of this column is blank; he is the second of the two 權少參事 counted in the column to the right. Book page 432 (the facing 篠山藩 entry) settles the convention: there 少參事 五人 is filled by two names in its own column plus two and then one in the two unlabelled columns to its left, and 權少參事 三人 by two in its own column plus one in the unlabelled column to its left — both reconcile exactly, so an unlabelled name column carries the overflow of the labelled office to its right."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "佐伯藩官員氏名山口藤左衛門"
